# Shared Code & Utilities Rule

This rule documents the structure and usage of the shared package in the Mozome Flutter project.

## Scope

- Applies to: `shared/` directory and related files.

## Topics

- Shared utilities and helper functions
- Common UI components and widgets
- Theme and styling definitions
- Configuration management
- Shared interfaces and models
- Cross-cutting concerns (logging, analytics, etc.)

## Best Practices

- Keep widgets reusable and stateless when possible
- Define consistent theme tokens and styles
- Maintain backward compatibility when updating shared components
- Write unit tests for all shared utilities
- Document component usage with examples

